   "hash": "31cdfd54",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.3#p1-31cdfd54",
     "text": "Which is a wood of long endurance.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "shittim wood"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.10.4",
   "range": "DEU.10.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "aeec1083",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.4#p1-aeec1083",
     "text": "When you were assembled to receive the Law.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "assembly"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.10.6",
   "range": "DEU.10.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9c49dc71",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.6#p1-9c49dc71",
     "text": "This mountain was also called Hor, Nu 20:28.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "Mosera",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 20:28",
       "ref": "NUM.20.28"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.10.8",
   "range": "DEU.10.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f9180761",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.8#p1-f9180761",
     "text": "That is, to offer sacrifice, and to declare the Law to the people.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "minister unto him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.10.9",
   "range": "DEU.10.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d00955b4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.9#p1-d00955b4",
     "text": "So God turned the curse of Jacob to a blessing Ge 49:7.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "inheritance with his brethren",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ge 49:7",
       "ref": "GEN.49.7"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.10.12",
   "range": "DEU.10.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a33a8cf4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.12#p1-a33a8cf4",
     "text": "For all our sins and transgressions God requires nothing but to turn to him and obey him.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "require of thee"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.10.15",
   "range": "DEU.10.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f8d0c07d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.15#p1-f8d0c07d",
     "text": "Although he was Lord of heaven and earth, he chose no one but you.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "Only the LORD had a delight"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.10.16",
   "range": "DEU.10.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "86947ef9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.16#p1-86947ef9",
     "text": "Cut off all your evil affections, Jer 4:4.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "Circumcise therefore the foreskin of your",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jer 4:4",
       "ref": "JER.4.4"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.10.20",
   "range": "DEU.10.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9bbe25a5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.10.20#p1-9bbe25a5",
     "text": "Read De 6:13.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "swear by his name",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "De 6:13",
       "ref": "DEU.6.13"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
